  "titulo": "Conjugate venir in the simple future",
  "subtitulo": "Venir swaps its i for a d: vendré, vendrás, vendremos.",
  "foto": "t02.jpg",
  "regla": "Venir replaces the i of its infinitive with d to make the stem vendr-, then adds -é, -ás, -á, -emos, -án.",
